What is the output of the following program?
```java
public class Main {
    static void evaluate(int code) {
        if (code == 0) throw new IllegalArgumentException("Zero");
        if (code < 0) throw new IllegalStateException("Negative");
    }
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        try {
            evaluate(0);
        } catch (IllegalArgumentException e) {
            System.out.print("Arg ");
